{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Water shall flow.</b> Behold, מים is singular in form, like מי נדה לא זורק עליו (waters of purification are not sprinkled upon him)." "<b>his buckets.</b> Like מדליותיו." "<b>and his seed in abundant waters.</b> Like seed that is watered with water; the meaning is that every day it shall sprout and grow." "<b>and higher than Agag shall be his king.</b> A prophecy concerning Saul, for he was the first king, because before Saul there were judges and not kings."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:17.462586902Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}